# Re-include the member repositories for ripgrep-based search tools.
# .gitignore hides them from git; .ignore takes precedence over .gitignore
# in ripgrep, so searches from the workspace root still see their files.
# Each repo's own .gitignore (target/, node_modules/, ...) still applies.
# Keep this list in sync with repos.tsv and .gitignore.
!/rusty-conduit-engine/
!/rusty-conduit/
!/rusty-conduit-ssh/
!/rusty-conduit-switch/
!/rusty-conduit-gui/
